Portions derived from NVIDIA RT-CV
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Some source files are derived from the RT-CV microservice in
https://github.com/NVIDIA-AI-Blueprints/video-search-and-summarization
(path services/rtvi/rt-cv, commit cf2160322a67580d750bfd1a0ad60faf1234541b),
Copyright (c) 2025-2026, NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights reserved.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Derived files (each carries the original notice and a modification notice):
  - src/app/main.c          <- src/metropolis_perception_app.c (main, lifecycle)
  - src/app/perf.c          <- src/metropolis_perception_app.c (perf callback)
  - src/app/Makefile        <- src/Makefile
  - src/app/timestamps.c    <- src/perception_utc.c (URI UTC parsing) and
                               src/metropolis_perception_app.c (timestamp generation, NTP checks)
  - src/app/embeddings.c    <- src/metropolis_perception_app.c (tracker ReID embedding cache)
  - src/app/ota.c           <- src/metropolis_perception_app.c (OTA model update)
  Not derived (written from scratch, RT-CV used only as a reference for behaviour):
  - src/app/probe.c, src/app/task_detect.c

