Runtime platform
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Perceptra is built to run on NVIDIA DeepStream SDK, TensorRT and CUDA, which are
NOT part of this repository and are licensed separately by NVIDIA. At build time
the binary is compiled against DeepStream sample application sources provided
inside the NVIDIA DeepStream container image; those sources are governed by their
own licence headers and are not redistributed in this repository.

